{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mano.hiking",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "自然とはずむ心",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mano.hiking",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mano.hiking",
    "idolId": "mano",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真的。水很清，连河底都看得见。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "踩着那些踏脚石，好像能走到更前面去。我去一下！",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "脚下小心点！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "好……我会小心的……嘿。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇……真的好漂亮……制作人，有好多鱼！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（真乃看起来很开心，不过身子是不是太往前倾了？）",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "喂——真乃！别掉下去——",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呀。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真乃，没事吧！？——来，抓住我的手！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "啊，谢谢您……稍微有点湿了……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "还在浅水处，算走运。快上岸把身上弄干。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这里能坐。没事吧，真乃？有没有哪里疼？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "好、好的，哪里都不疼……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "对不起，让您担心了……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "别放在心上。总之没受伤就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "可是，我把鱼吓跑了。大家都逃走了……大失败……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "鱼的事别担心，很快就会像什么都没发生一样回来的。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（先让她平静一下再说吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……啊，有鸟……",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦，真的。什么时候到附近的……",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇，好漂亮……",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那是很稀有的鸟吗，真乃？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "是的，是只住在山里的鸟……能遇到真开心。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊…………来山里是对的。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "是的！",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……呵呵。制作人果然很温柔呢。"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "制作人，今天带大家远足，谢谢你！",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "灯织和巡也都在……能一起来，我真的很高兴。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哪里，我也能和大家一起松口气。天气放晴真是太好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "是的！正适合出门，心情特别好。",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真乃今天笑得比平时还好看。",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "是、是吗……？谢谢您……",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦……你看，前面能看到河了！",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……呼哇。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "好厉害……非常漂亮！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
